Master UI/UX & Bug Fix Implementation Plan
A comprehensive, product-designer level plan to fix place card layout anomalies, text overflows, map pin misalignments, and refine mobile & desktop user experiences across the entire BanglaPath suite.

User Review Required
IMPORTANT

Place Card Layout Redesign: The standalone gray arch element created by 3-column flex wrapping of ratings will be eliminated. Ratings (⭐ 4.7 (6K+)) will be seamlessly integrated into the card header/footer alongside titles and tag pills.
Text Overflow Prevention: All card titles, tags, blurbs, and PDP text elements will have strict line clamping (line-clamp: 2, overflow: hidden, text-overflow: ellipsis) so text never spills onto the page background.
Map Pin Recalibration: The Bangladesh 3D map container (#map-frame) and pin coordinates (x%, y%) will be locked to the map graphic image aspect ratio so pins sit accurately over Dhaka, Sundarbans, Sylhet, Cox's Bazar, etc., instead of grouping at the bottom.
